{"a":[89,89],"h":"<p>89.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"68\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 68.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 29.3 29.3 37.6 45.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 37.6 45.0 51.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> artık ona bir revh-REVH, rahat, rahmet, ferah, hayatı daime ma'nalarına gelir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 33.7 46.4 46.4 53.3 61.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 53.3 61.4 69.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ve bir reyhan - güzel bir rızk <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"115\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 114.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 32.3 32.3 39.0 45.7 54.7 54.7 71.3 71.3 78.0 90.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 71.3 78.0 90.0 98.3\" y=\"25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bir neıym Cenneti - hiç kederi olmıyan bir ni'met ve saadet Cenneti 90. </p>"}